<title>USA: St Paul hogs $2.00-3.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $2.00-3.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00-3.00 lower. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs    60.00, late 59.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs    58.50-60.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs    57.50-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs    56.50-58.50</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs    55.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 3-4     290-300 lbs    54.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows: lighter weights 2.00-2.50 lower, heavier weights 1.00 lower. Top 47.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-550 lbs   45.50</p>
<p>	     500-700 lbs   47.00</p>
</text>
